# Revisions to skip when running `git blame`, because they changed layout and
# nothing else. Enable once per clone:
#
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# GitHub and recent git read this file automatically for blame views.

# style: apply the recorded rustfmt style
#
# The first `cargo fmt` this repository ever had. It could not run before:
# there was no rustfmt.toml, rustfmt's default max_width is 100, and this code
# is written at ~110 columns - so the check failed on 99 of ~100 files and
# running it would have rewritten nearly all of them. GM-221 recovered the
# intended style by measurement (see rustfmt.toml) and this commit applied it,
# across 91 files, touching nothing else.
